---
import type { Locale } from '@/i18n/locale';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const es = locale === 'es';
// Each new pod has to be healthy before an old one is terminated.
const replacements = [
  { newPodStartsAt: 1000, oldPodEndsAt: 2600 },
  { newPodStartsAt: 3200, oldPodEndsAt: 4800 },
];
---

<figure class="rolling-deployment">
  <p class="result">
    <strong>0 downtime</strong>
    <span>{es ? 'al desplegar una nueva versión' : 'when deploying a new version'}</span>
  </p>
  <div class="resource-tree" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="resource deployment">Deployment</span>
    <span class="branch"></span>
    <span class="resource replica-set old-set">ReplicaSet v1</span>
    <span class="link old-set"></span>
    <div class="pods old-set">
      {replacements.map(({ oldPodEndsAt }) => (
        <span class="pod is-old" style={`--change-at: ${oldPodEndsAt}ms;`}>
          pod
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
    <span class="resource replica-set new-set">ReplicaSet v2</span>
    <span class="link new-set"></span>
    <div class="pods new-set">
      {replacements.map(({ newPodStartsAt }) => (
        <span class="pod is-new" style={`--change-at: ${newPodStartsAt}ms;`}>
          pod
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="sr-only">
    {es
      ? 'Un Deployment de dos réplicas pasa de la versión 1 a la 2: cada pod nuevo arranca y, solo cuando está sano, se elimina uno antiguo.'
      : 'A two-replica Deployment moves from version 1 to version 2: each new pod starts and, only once it is healthy, an old one is removed.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .rolling-deployment {
    --node-height: clamp(1.75rem, 4.8svh, 2.5rem);
    --link-width: var(--space-4);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    align-items: end;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .result {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .result strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.9vw, var(--font-size-display));
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .result > span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .resource-tree {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto var(--link-width) auto var(--link-width) minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, var(--node-height));
    align-items: center;
    row-gap: var(--space-2);
    min-width: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .resource {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 100%;
    padding-inline: var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-small);
  }

  .deployment {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    height: var(--node-height);
  }
  .branch {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    height: calc(var(--node-height) + var(--space-2));
    margin-inline-start: 50%;
    border: solid var(--color-ink);
    border-width: 1px 0 1px 1px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .branch::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: 100%;
    width: calc(var(--link-width) / 2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
  }

  .replica-set {
    grid-column: 3;
  }
  .link {
    grid-column: 4;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
  }
  .pods {
    grid-column: 5;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    height: 100%;
  }
  .old-set {
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .new-set {
    grid-row: 2;
  }

  .pod {
    display: grid;
    flex: 1 1 0;
    place-items: center;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-small);
  }

  .is-new {
    color: var(--color-accent-ink);
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* The old replica set ends empty: its slots stay as a trace of what was replaced. */
  .is-old {
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-text-soft);
    color: transparent;
    background: transparent;
  }

  @keyframes new-pod-becomes-healthy {
    0% {
      border: 1px dashed var(--color-text-soft);
      color: transparent;
      background: transparent;
    }
    10%,
    85% {
      border: 1px dashed var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      background: transparent;
    }
    100% {
      border: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-accent-ink);
      background: var(--color-accent);
    }
  }

  @keyframes old-pod-terminates {
    0% {
      border: 1px solid var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-paper);
      background: var(--color-ink);
    }
    100% {
      border: 1px dashed var(--color-text-soft);
      color: transparent;
      background: transparent;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) and (min-height: 34rem) {
    :global(.js) :global(.station) .rolling-deployment {
      visibility: hidden;
    }
    :global(.js) :global(.station.is-current) .rolling-deployment {
      visibility: visible;
    }

    :global(.js) :global(.station.is-current) .is-new {
      animation: new-pod-becomes-healthy 1300ms linear calc(450ms + var(--change-at)) both;
    }
    :global(.js) :global(.station.is-current) .is-old {
      animation: old-pod-terminates 350ms linear calc(450ms + var(--change-at)) both;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .rolling-deployment {
      --node-height: 1.5rem;
      --link-width: var(--space-2);
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2);
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
    }

    .result strong {
      font-size: var(--font-size-heading-1);
    }
    .result > span {
      font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    }
    .resource-tree {
      row-gap: var(--space-1);
      font-size: 0.625rem;
    }
    .branch {
      height: calc(var(--node-height) + var(--space-1));
    }
    .resource {
      padding-inline: var(--space-1);
    }
    .pods {
      gap: var(--space-1);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) and (max-height: 44rem) {
    .rolling-deployment {
      --node-height: 0.875rem;
      gap: 0.125rem;
      margin-top: var(--space-1);
    }
    .result strong {
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 6vw, var(--font-size-heading-2));
    }
    .result > span {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: var(--font-size-meta);
    }
    .resource-tree {
      row-gap: 0.125rem;
      font-size: 0.5625rem;
    }
    .branch {
      height: calc(var(--node-height) + 0.125rem);
    }
  }
</style>
